# Convex dev deployment URL — shown by `npx convex dev` after `npx convex login`.
# Example: https://reliable-panther-823.convex.cloud
# The DeviceProof harness (src/device-proof) runs the 3-request photo upload
# against the real dev deployment when this is set; when unset it falls back to
# a deterministic in-memory fake transport. Never commit this file or real URLs.
EXPO_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
